  "created": "2026-10-29T10:56:17.687Z",
  "description": "Pure C# JPEG XL plugin for PictureSharp. Detects and identifies JPEG XL files (raw codestream and container), decodes still lossy (VarDCT, XYB) and lossless (Modular) images, including recompressed JPEGs, patches and progressive files, encodes images lossily (VarDCT with quality, distance and effort 1-9, about as small as cjxl, the default) or losslessly (8-bit or 16-bit Modular, about as small as cjxl -d 0 -e 7), losslessly transcodes sequential and progressive 8-bit JPEG with byte-exact original reconstruction, and reads, writes and edits the ICC profile, EXIF and XMP (also Brotli-compressed).",
  "id": "PictureSharp.Jxl",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-29T10:59:57.647Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "Z5SMOBXciY2RP977Hkv7rVlFb25H4bflQUuSgUVI1MXlbI1TzTshSmaKSFjljpkx5jAQAiLVX/G1LZ7psOr3dg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 317300,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-10-29T10:56:17.687Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.0: SIMD (AVX2 with FMA, SSE4.1, scalar fallback) for DCT/IDCT, colour conversion, Gaborish/EPF, dequantization, pixel output and the lossy encoder. On an AVX2 CPU under JIT, single-threaded: VarDCT decode 2.8-3.8x, lossy encode 1.4x (effort 1-3) and 2.4-2.6x (effort 5-7) faster than 0.7.10; Modular and JPEG reconstruction unchanged. Encoded bytes, decoded pixels, metadata edits and JPEG reconstruction remain identical to 0.7.10. No API changes. Native AOT uses AVX2/FMA only when published with IlcInstructionSet=x86-64-v3 or native; see docs/releases/release-0.8.0.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
